\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S48}{\ignorespaces Retrieval-query $\times $ scoring-frame grid under the released evaluator (461-item subset; sacreBLEU-4; descriptive paired bootstrap CIs, 10{,}000 resamples). The response is positive only on the diagonal where the retrieval query coincides with the scoring reference. The two selectors pick the same donor for only 6.5\% of queries; human-query donors still average Jaccard 0.30 to the original reference texts (canonical selector: 0.55; human-query selector against the human text: 0.33).\relax }}{49}{table.caption.151}\protected@file@percent }
